    `,expectedTypeErrors:1,expectedErrorLines:[5],expectedErrorSubstrings:["In 'do' notation: 'flatMap' function is not defined in scope","desugar bindings like 'x <- expr' into 'flatMap(expr, (x) => ...)'"]},{id:"test_err_do_notation_missing_pure",name:"Do Notation Error: Smart Humanized Diagnostic for Missing pure Function",category:"Monads & Do Notation",description:"Verifies that using pure in a do block without pure in scope explains how pure(val) lifts values into the monad.",code:`
